    "title": "BREAKING: Major police response to ongoing incident in downtown Minneapolis - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joe Nelson ,\n9 hours ago A significant police response is underway in downtown Minneapolis.\nBring Me The News is working to confirm what’s going on amid numerous unconfirmed reports of a shooting at the Loring Towers, located at 15 East Grant Street.\nAerial photos from a downtown building also show police activity near the Nicollet Mall Target, which is located less than a mile from the Loring Towers. In the image provided to Bring Me The News, there appears to be a sedan with front-end damage in the intersection, and a police cruiser with rear-end damage.\nPolice activity and apparent crash outside Target in Minneapolis. Submitted photo\nIt’s unclear if the two scenes are related.\nThis is a developing story.",
    "summary": "6 hours ago A significant police response is underway in downtown Minneapolis. Bring Me The News is working to confirm what’s going on amid numerous unconfirmed reports of a shooting at the Loring Towers, located at 15 East Grant Street. Aerial photos from a downtown building also show police activity near the Nicollet Mall Target, which is located less than a mile from the Loring Towers. In the image provided to Bring Me The News, there appears to be a sedan with front-end damage in the intersection, and a police cruiser with rear-end damage.",
